Description:
This directory contains a subset of the components provided by the
Polymer project. See bower.json for a full list of components.

The version can be found in components/polymer/.bower.json. The license can
be found in LICENSE.polymer.

The source git repositories can be found at:
https://github.com/Polymer/<component>

Note on Bower - New components can be added by editing bower.json and running
`bower update`, which requires first installing bower (see http://bower.io/).

